Driving
3. Spootiskerry [G] / Dancing Bear [Em]
4. Road to California [D]/ Shenandoah Falls [A] 

Balancy As
5. Du Pop à Ars [G]/ Snow Day [A]

Balancey Bs
6. Nail that Catfish to a Tree II [G]/ Red Prairie Dawn [A]

Big finish
7. Devil in the Strawstack [Gm]/ Benton’s Dream [Amix]

Bouncy
*8. Coleraine [Am]/ Miller's Maggot [G]

Groovy
*9. The Orphan [Em]/ Wild One [Dm]

Marchy
10. Jamie Allen [G]/ Road to Boston [D] 

Fun
