Elegant/Englishy
12. Cockle Shells [F]/ Tom Kruskal's  [A]

Old-time/squares
13. North Carolina Breakdown [G]/ Sandy Boys [A]

New England/Quebecois
14. L’Air Mignonne [G]/ Deshabille Toi [D]/ St Antoines [French Canadian]

Waltzes
15. Midnight on the Water [D]
16. Ookpik Waltz [G]

* Jigs%%endtext%%newpage
